<http://data.silknow.org/object/55e611d1-91f6-3fba-9c48-a831534fe6a6>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel of embroidered stain, shaped for a chair back. Pink satin ground, embroidered in chain, knotted and darning stitches, with plyed cream silk yarns. Allover pattern showing slender serpentine stalks bearing a variety of conventional blossoms and leaves. A few stains; rusted nail holes along edges (turned under in mounting)."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2ff20905-ea5f-388d-99a4-dbc981d7d185> ;
